      "level": 2,
      "content": "8.2 Important Firsts in Madhya Pradesh"
    },
    {
      "id": "gw2293c",
      "type": "list",
      "items": [
        "First Chief Minister - Ravi Shankar Shukla (1956)",
        "First woman Governor - Sarla Grewal (1993)",
        "First woman Chief Minister - Uma Bharati (2003)",
        "First state to have Right to Service Act - MP (2010)",
        "First solar-powered village in India - Tinchu village, Betul, MP",
        "First state with e-Cabinet system - MP",
        "First state to implement Right to Recall - MP",
        "First state to implement CM helpline (181) - MP"
      ]
    },
